  "contentHtml": "<p>구글 타임랩스 서비스는 1984년부터 작년(2020년)까지 인공 위성 사진을 타임랩스로 보여주는 서비스 입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>지권의 변화 과정 설명할 때, 우리가 사는 지역의 변화 과정을 보여줬더니,&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아이들이 좋아했습니다.^^&#160; -&#160; 지구 온난화로, 빙하가 없어지는 것 등은 높은 해상도로 볼 수 있습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래는 저희 학교(화성시 동탄지역) 근처의 타임랩스 모습 입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f5a008b4dc828ccb1f13168805a5cd7ef84d9ee9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f5a008b4dc828ccb1f13168805a5cd7ef84d9ee9\" data-origin-width=\"1434\" data-origin-height=\"816\"><div class=\"figcaption\">동탄지역 타임랩스(1984-2020)</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://earthengine.google.com/timelapse/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://earthengine.google.com/timelapse/</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Google Timelapse\" data-og-description=\"Explore the dynamics of our changing planet over the past three and a half decades.\" data-og-host=\"earthengine.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://earthengine.google.com/timelapse/\" data-og-url=\"https://earthengine.google.com/timelapse/\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Ftshe/hyKdLwOOgw/rB7OEug0lWRFa1H2EsKfy0/img.jpg?width=1920&amp;height=1011&amp;face=0_0_1920_1011,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/FlRjh/hyKdGPNKFz/p9o0Cw5xNyJFRDr0q6xeIk/img.jpg?width=1220&amp;height=1220&amp;face=0_0_1220_1220,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/kgRYG/hyKdPTvEGI/Tklope3rOoVLopMukAEcnk/img.jpg?width=1220&amp;height=1220&amp;face=0_0_1220_1220\"><a href=\"https://earthengine.google.com/timelapse/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://earthengine.google.com/timelapse/\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Ftshe/hyKdLwOOgw/rB7OEug0lWRFa1H2E